OL,3,GNEWSAFourth person charged after teen
OL,4,Akilled in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fourth person has been charged after
OL,7,Fthe death of 18-year-old Ceiran Evans
OL,8,Ffollowing a crash.
OL,10,FThe teenager died in a collision
OL,11,Fbetween a car and an off-road bike on
OL,12,FPen Cae Crwn Road in Gorseinon,
OL,13,FSwansea, on 9 July.
OL,15,FTrisha Thomas, 36, from Gorseinon, has
OL,16,Fbeen charged with assisting an offender
OL,17,Fafter being arrested on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
