OL,3,GNEWSAFourth person charged after teen
OL,4,Akilled in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FElliot Truelove, 33, from West Cross,
OL,7,FSwansea, and Liam Thomas, 18, from
OL,8,FMorriston, Swansea, appeared at Swansea
OL,9,FMagistrates' Court charged with murder
OL,10,Fand attempted murder earlier this
OL,11,Fmonth.
